            "review_title": "Review at Reboot Bistro",
            "review_text": "Chris Low\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam29 contributions\n0\nEasy Going Bistro for food and drinks along Pasteur Street.\nApr 2024 • Friends\nEasy going bistro with no pressure unlike other places. Great food and ambience for a place to enjoy Singapore Food or to have a relaxing drink together with friends.\nInsider tip:\nWorth trying Bak Chor Mee, Laksa & Nasi Lemak.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 22, 2024",
